<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφᾰκελ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffer from</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάκελος</span>, <i>to be gangrened,
				mortify</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσφακέλισέ τε τὸ ὀστέον καὶ ὁ μηρὸς
					ἐσάπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.66
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφακελίσαντος τοῦ μηροῦ καὶ σαπέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.136
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				74b
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				84b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				519b6
			</span></i>; of the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				26.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				28.32
			</span></i>: also in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁκόσοισιν ἂν σφακελισθῇ ὁ ἐγκέφαλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					7.50
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i> (v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			the effect of severe cold on single limbs, <i>to be
			frost-bitten</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				12.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of plants
			and trees, <i>to be blighted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Juv.</u>
				470a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to have spasms</i> or <i>convulsions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορεῖν καὶ ς. τῷ δεινῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					342
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				80
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
